# ── Flax HI CA / BIOS trust-anchor swap — NEVER COMMIT ───────────────────────
# The HI CA private key is a durable signing secret (losing it means re-flashing
# BIOS with a new anchor). AMI CA material and the modified, non-distributable
# AMI BIOS images must never enter this tree. The method tooling is kept local
# (belongs in a private/internal repo, not this open-source one).
flax-ca*.pem
*-ca-key.pem
ca-key.pem
image-bios
*_TPC_P26*.bin
*flaxca*.bin
*flax_TPC_P26*.bin
tools/bios-ca-swap/
